# Hermes Web docker build context — keep it minimal so the pnpm build only sees
# source, never local secrets/artifacts/upstream symlinks.
**/node_modules
**/.vite
**/dist
**/logs
result
.env
apps/desktop
apps/shared
*.log
.git
.gitignore
.github
PLAN.md
*.md.bak
.obsidian
.renderer

test-results
playwright-report

# Android signing/Firebase inputs and local runtime data never belong in a web image context.
.athena
apps/android
android-release
*.jks
*.keystore
**/google-services.json
